// Variation blocks and their alternatives.

== snapshot.variations
@sequence:
    - mira: It's a fridge.
    - mira (smug): Still a fridge.
    - mira: I refuse to look at this fridge again.
@cycle: #id:c9wq2a
    - mira: Dusty.
    - mira: Very dusty.
        @wait 0.5s
        @sfx sneeze
    - @jump snapshot.elsewhere
    -
        @if $has_key:
            mira: I could use the key.
        mira: Anyway.
    - // A comment after the dash is a bare dash.
        @end
@once: #id:b8k2qd
    mira: Whoa, a secret panel!
    @set $found_panel = true
- A dash outside a variation is text.
-
mira (sad): #thought
